md Tier 2 section whenever a project configures glossary entries.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase glossary group with list and show[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: register the `sase glossary` command group with project selection, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the filtered multi-format `list` subcommand, and the recursive `show` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]subcommand with its provenance-annotated rendering.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase glossary read and log[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]audit[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]audit: add the reason-requiring `read` wrapper that appends an audited [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]event before printing show output, and the `log` dashboard that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]summarizes recorded reads by term, by agent, and by event.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]GLOSSARY lane in the agent metadata panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after audit[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel: add the per-agent glossary-read loader and render a GLOSSARY [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sub-section in the SASE CONTEXT section of the agent metadata panel, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]showing each read's terms, related-term count, and reason.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation, completion spec, and end-to-end sweep[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, init, cli, audit, panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: update the CLI, configuration, init, memory, and ACE documentation[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for the new command and the retired note, regenerate the completion spec[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot, and run the exhaustive verification lane over the combined [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tree.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-op","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-op.4","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-fc085187629bc3c0b125a3310964027e","started_at":"2026-08-17T18:02:39.562538+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-op","bbugyi200.athena.sase-op.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-op.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-op.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-op.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-op.5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-op.6","bbugyi200.athena.sase-op.land"]}
